      en: ["Network consists of more than 480 limestone caves.", "Served as the Pathet Lao headquarters from 1964 to 1973.", "Sheltered roughly 23,000 people during the bombing campaigns.", "The complex included a fully functional 150-bed hospital.", "Kaysone Phomvihane's cave contains a reinforced blast-proof room.", "Designated as a national heritage site and museum in 2001."],
