      en: ["The statue was officially unveiled in November 2010.", "Chao Anouvong was the last king of Vientiane, ruling until 1828.", "The bronze statue stands 6 meters tall on its pedestal.", "It faces across the Mekong River toward Thailand.", "The park is a major venue for public celebrations and exercise.", "The monument commemorates the 450th anniversary of the capital."],
